{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digihealth",
 "version": "1.1",
 "title": "digihealth",
 "description": "A SETTINGS row, SYSTEM INFO: CPU load, the audio render's load (DSP: the main CPU's effects and mix; the FM voices run on the second CPU) and free RAM in the top bar, and a read-only USB diagnostics channel (SysEx device 0x7D) that answers tools/digiusb.py. For the Digitone mk1 and Digitone Keys; FAST AUDIO is Digitakt only.",
